%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: SandroIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Sorry \u2014 I was watching the way the light hits the roof opposite. The ash gives it this amber quality. Here, my documents."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Sandro Kakhidze. I\u2019m a mechanic. Workshop on the south row. Mostly cars, occasionally stranger things."
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "The work\u2019s changed a bit. People bring me things they can\u2019t afford to replace, asking me to keep them running. I don\u2019t always have the parts."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Does that frustrate you?
      npcResponse: "Sometimes. But there\u2019s something about fixing a thing that shouldn\u2019t work anymore. It\u2019s hopeful. Which I know sounds strange right now."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: Busy workshop?
      npcResponse: "It comes and goes. People either bring everything in or they stop coming entirely. Not much in between lately."
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "I live with my partner, Irakli. Six years. He works nights now so we don\u2019t overlap much. That\u2019s its own kind of strange."
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "I had a book in my jacket this morning. Left it on a bench somewhere. Didn\u2019t notice until I\u2019d walked ten minutes. That kind of day."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Do you ever feel like you're reading the same chapter twice? The city looks different each morning but something underneath it keeps repeating.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "Same papers, different faces. Or the other way around. I\u2019ve been thinking about that a lot."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I know what you mean.
      npcResponse: "Right. You see it in this booth. There\u2019s a poem in it somewhere. I just haven\u2019t found the last line."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: That's a poetic way to put it.
      npcResponse: My partner says I make everything a poem. He's not wrong. Occupational habit.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
  - type: 0
    npcLine: My papers. October expiry, I believe. Yes, October. Thank you.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
